  "body": "Welcome to your next family home—a beautifully maintained, light-filled sanctuary designed for comfort and effortless living.\r\n\r\nStep inside and discover:\r\n- Four generously sized bedrooms—with two Master bedrooms, each offering a peaceful escape for every member of the family.\r\n- Three pristine, modern bathrooms—making busy mornings smooth and stress-free.\r\n- A sun-drenched open-plan living area—perfect for entertaining friends or unwinding with loved ones.\r\n- A well-appointed kitchen—catering to home chefs and casual cooks alike.\r\n- Seamless indoor-outdoor flow—enjoy alfresco dining or simply relax while taking in the sea breeze and beautiful seaviews.\r\n- Secure internal garage—providing peace of mind, extra storage, and all-weather convenience.\r\n\r\nPrime Browns Bay Location:\r\nLocated just minutes from local schools, vibrant cafes, family-friendly parks, and the stunning Browns Bay Beach. Enjoy the best of North Shore living, where every day feels like a holiday.\r\n\r\nKey Features at a Glance:\r\n- 4 spacious bedrooms\r\n- 3 modern bathrooms\r\n- Secure single garage\r\n- Light-filled, open-plan living\r\n- Seaviews and outdoor entertaining\r\n- Prestigious Browns Bay address\r\n\r\nDon’t Miss Out!\r\nExceptional family homes with seaviews are rare. Overseas vendors want it SOLD.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange a private viewing and make this exceptional property your new home.",
